flowchart LR
  Guest[Khach chua dang nhap] --> Public[Landing / Auth APIs]
  User[User da dang nhap] --> FE[Next.js Browser]
  Admin[Admin da dang nhap] --> FE
  FE -->|HTTPS cookie + CSRF| API[FastAPI Gateway]
  FE <-->|WS ticket + PCM + result| WS[Streaming WebSocket]
  Public --> API
  API -->|RBAC + session| DB[(MongoDB Replica Set)]
  API --> Queue[(Redis Job/Progress)]
  WS --> Worker[Inference Worker]
  Worker --> DB
  Worker --> Queue
  Worker -->|cache model revision| HFHub[Hugging Face Hub]
  Worker -.->|user consent + enabled| HFRemote[HF Inference Remote]
  API -->|create payment order| Payment[payOS / SePay / PSP]
  Payment -->|verified signed HTTPS webhook| Webhook[Webhook Ingress]
  Webhook -->|signature + dedupe| API
  Admin -.->|admin-only warmup/reload| Worker
  API --> Mon[Metrics Endpoint]
  WS --> Mon
  User -.->|only owned sessions| Mon
